      "body": "Hi maintainers 👋\n\nIt looks like CI did not actually run on this PR — all test jobs were skipped because the `run-ci` label is missing (the `pr-gate` job failed at the \"Require run-ci label\" step, so every downstream stage was skipped). No tests have been executed yet.\n\nCould someone with write access add the `run-ci` label (or run `/tag-and-rerun-ci`) so CI can pick this up? Happy to address any review feedback once tests pass.\n\nThanks!",
